#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:74
msgid "备战室（室内场景）"
msgstr "Briefing Room (Indoor Scene)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:76
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;备战室中主要会有各式武器架和储物柜，可以参考张双帕弥什游戏首屏场景的设计，另外备战室的墙壁上可以出现很大军事学院的 "
"LOGO，另外桌椅或是房间内的饰物可以是有些中式风格的物件（中国结、茶壶或是中式灯笼等等）。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The briefing room mainly features various weapon racks and "
"storage lockers. The design can reference the home screen scene of "
"Punishing: Gray Raven. Additionally, a large Military Academy LOGO can "
"appear on the briefing room walls. The desks, chairs, or room decorations"
" can feature some Chinese-style objects (Chinese knots, teapots, or "
"Chinese lanterns, etc.)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:79
msgid "备战室"
msgstr "Briefing Room"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:83
msgid "备战室（画师：桀）"
msgstr "Briefing Room (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:86
msgid "虚拟训练场（室内场景）"
msgstr "Virtual Training Ground (Indoor Scene)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:88
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;因为军事学院的物资和活动场地有限，所以学员在参与实战之前都会通过玩VR "
"设备使进入虚拟训练场来试用各式武器，以及模拟对抗各式变异生物体。虚拟训练场是一个数字信号模拟的空间，所以没有复杂的场景，只有指示空间的线条，以及放置着一些用中文编写的程序代码的展示墙。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Because the Military Academy has limited supplies and "
"activity space, cadets use VR equipment to enter the virtual training "
"ground before participating in actual combat, to try out various weapons "
"and simulate battles against different mutant creatures. The virtual "
"training ground is a digitally simulated space, so there are no complex "
"scenes — only lines indicating the space, and display walls featuring "
"program code written in Chinese."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:91
msgid "训练室"
msgstr "Training Room"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:95
msgid "训练室（画师：桀）"
msgstr "Training Room (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:98
msgid "虚拟训练场"
