msgstr "Virtual Training Ground (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:105
msgid "指挥室（室内场景）"
msgstr "Command Room (Indoor Scene)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:107
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;指挥所主要是由学院长带领情报团队收集分析任务环境数据，并给战斗队伍提供战术建议的工作场所。主要有与战斗队伍进行视频通讯的指挥台，各式的大屏以及工作电脑等。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The command center is primarily a workplace where the academy"
" superintendent leads an intelligence team to collect and analyze mission"
" environment data and provide tactical advice to combat teams. It mainly "
"features a command console for video communication with combat teams, "
"various large screens, and work computers."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:110
msgid "指挥室"
msgstr "Command Room"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:114
msgid "指挥室（画师：桀）"
msgstr "Command Room (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:117
msgid "武器研发实验室（室内场景）"
msgstr "Weapon R&D Laboratory (Indoor Scene)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:119
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;武器研发实验室是进行各式军备研发测试的场所，因为装备制造使用的设备自动化程度比较高，并且以3D "
"打印设备为主，生产测试均为流水线作业，所以整个环境比较整洁而有序。技术研发工程师主要通过编程和软件仿真技术进行直接的开发操作，所以不需要进行任何生产器械的手工操作。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The Weapon R&D Laboratory is a facility for developing and "
"testing various armaments. Because the equipment used for manufacturing "
"is highly automated and primarily based on 3D printing, with production "
"and testing following an assembly-line process, the entire environment is"
" relatively clean and orderly. Technical R&D engineers primarily conduct "
"development operations through programming and software simulation "
"technology, so no manual operation of production equipment is required."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:122
msgid "武器研发实验室"
msgstr "Weapon R&D Laboratory"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:126
msgid "武器研发实验室（画师：桀）"
msgstr "Weapon R&D Laboratory (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:129
msgid "休息间（室内场景）"
msgstr "Lounge (Indoor Scene)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:131
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;休息间主要是学员们在战斗和训练外，进行放松休闲的场所，有吧台沙发等休息区域。场景中间有一面展示墙，上面会展示一些探索地面世界或是击败强大怪物后收集的纪念品，或是学院经营取得一些成绩后获得的奖章和奖杯。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The lounge is primarily a place for cadets to relax and "
"unwind outside of combat and training. It has a bar, sofas, and other "
"rest areas. In the middle of the scene, there is a display wall "
"showcasing souvenirs collected from exploring the surface world or "
"defeating powerful monsters, as well as medals and trophies earned "
"through the academy's achievements."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:134
msgid "休息间"
msgstr "Lounge"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:138
msgid "休息间（画师：桀）"
msgstr "Lounge (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:141
msgid "二、人类遗迹（游戏世界）"
msgstr "2. Human Ruins (Game World)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:145
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;因为太阳加速进入红巨星期，开始发出异常的太阳辐射和发生更加频繁的太阳风暴现象。地球表面的气候在接收更加强烈的不稳定的太阳辐射下，开始发生异常剧烈的气候变化。海洋里的水分大量蒸发进入空气中。受到太阳照射强烈的地区都会迅速变成极度炎热潮湿的气候。并且昼夜温差达到了近80摄氏度，白日是会让人迅速中暑昏厥的酷热，夜间是让水汽在世间万物表面迅速凝结成冰晶的极寒。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;同时在强烈太阳风暴的冲击下，地球的地轴倾角变得越来越大，地球变得几乎是躺倒在绕太阳公转的轨道上。有更多的地区进入了极昼或是极夜的自然状态中。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;变成极端气候的地球表面已经不再适合人类居住和生活。但在自然选择的作用下，这样的世界却变成了一些生命力极强适应下来的变异动植物们的乐园。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;过去繁荣的地上城市，已在不得已中全数被人类所遗弃。在离开人类不久的时间里就被各式绿色植物（参天树木和藤蔓）所覆盖，由于有的植物长势过于旺盛，甚至于松动了建筑物根基，使一些高层建筑变得倾斜或是倒塌。很多人类建筑物的外表因为生长的蕨类苔藓或是藤蔓的根系侵蚀，也变得破损不堪。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;As the Sun accelerated into its red giant phase, it began "
"emitting abnormal solar radiation and experiencing more frequent solar "
"storms. The Earth's surface climate, receiving more intense and unstable "
"solar radiation, began to undergo extraordinarily violent changes. Large "
"amounts of water from the oceans evaporated into the atmosphere. Areas "
"receiving strong sunlight rapidly became extremely hot and humid "
"climates. The temperature difference between day and night reached nearly"
" 80 degrees Celsius — the daytime heat would cause rapid heatstroke and "
"fainting, while the nighttime cold would cause water vapor to quickly "
"condense into ice crystals on the surface of everything in the world.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;At the same time, under the impact of intense solar storms, "
"the Earth's axial tilt became increasingly larger, causing the Earth to "
"lie almost flat on its orbital path around the Sun. More regions entered "
"a natural state of perpetual day or perpetual night.   &emsp;&emsp;The "
"Earth's surface, transformed into an extreme climate, was no longer "
"suitable for human habitation and life. However, through natural "
"selection, this world became a paradise for some mutant flora and fauna "
"with extremely strong vitality that managed to adapt.   &emsp;&emsp;The "
"once-prosperous surface cities had all been abandoned by humans out of "
"necessity. Shortly after humans left, they were covered by various green "
"plants (towering trees and vines). Some plants grew so vigorously that "
"they even loosened building foundations, causing some high-rise buildings"
" to tilt or collapse. The exteriors of many human buildings became "
"severely damaged due to erosion from growing ferns, moss, and vine roots."

