#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:170
msgid "极夜冰封之城（室外场景）"
msgstr "Polar Night Frozen City (Outdoor Scene)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:172
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;身处新极夜地区的城市，被完全的冰雪覆盖每一个建筑如同被封存在深蓝色的玻璃橱窗中，地面上有厚厚的积雪，天空不断飞舞着雪花。在雪地中仔细看，竟然还有一棵变异的巨大樱花树，樱花树下已经无法区分飘落的到底是雪花还是樱花"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Cities located in the new polar night region are completely "
"covered in ice and snow. Each building appears as if sealed inside a deep"
" blue glass display case. The ground is covered with thick accumulated "
"snow, and snowflakes constantly dance in the sky. Looking carefully in "
"the snow, there is surprisingly a giant mutant cherry blossom tree. "
"Beneath the cherry tree, it is impossible to distinguish whether what is "
"falling are snowflakes or cherry blossoms."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:175
msgid "冰封之城"
msgstr "Frozen City"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:179
msgid "冰封之城（画师：桀）"
msgstr "Frozen City (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:182
msgid "三、世界地铁（游戏世界）"
msgstr "3. World Metro (Game World)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:186
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;因为地表气候恶劣和具有攻击性的变异动物横行，人们开始进一步修建地铁，打通了各个城市的地铁系统。形成了地下更加复杂的世界地铁线路，世界地铁线路时不时也会遭受变异生物的侵入而暂停营运，或是因为地质塌方而产生废弃线路。因为缺乏人力维护，现在运营的世界地铁线设施都看起来特别陈旧和破败。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Because of the harsh surface climate and aggressive mutant "
"animals running rampant, people began further constructing subways, "
"connecting the metro systems of various cities. This formed an even more "
"complex underground World Metro network. The World Metro lines "
"occasionally suffer intrusions from mutant creatures, causing service "
"suspensions, or produce abandoned routes due to geological collapses. Due"
" to lack of manpower for maintenance, the currently operating World Metro"
" facilities all look particularly old and dilapidated."

