#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:215
msgid "四、地下城市（游戏世界）"
msgstr "4. Underground City (Game World)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:217
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;游戏世界玩家生活的地下城市大致分为四种地形：唯三的巨大的圆柱中空“主竖井”，狭长密集的居住区域“管道”，宽敞、四通八达横向连接各个部分的“地铁”，以及用于地面和地下运输的“电梯”。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;“主竖井”为主要的地下城居民活动区域，包括了商业区、能源设备、行政区等综合功能，竖井的最上方为巨大的过滤辐射的单透镜。由于竖井深度很深，只有在正午极为短暂的时间有入沐圣光的光照，其余时间都是不熄灭的霓虹灯和电子屏的光亮（在白日到来前，会有一段熄灯等待光的仪式）。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;“管道”是居民休息的空间。管道区域划分为十二个区域（六内区，六外区，身份越尊居住越靠近核心）。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;“地铁”是平面交通道路，运行速度极快，十分便捷，半小时内可以到达地下城的任意一个地方。位于三个主竖井的中心是地铁的“大枢纽”，此处为大型的中空区域，有立体的调度轨道以及中控核心。地铁列车的每节车厢可以单独运作，实现行驶途中分离分配入不同轨道。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;“电梯”是纵向交通道路，配有巨大的升降平台、紧急弹射竖轨和备用的楼梯（虽然几乎没人愿意爬这个楼梯）。平台常用于运输军队和大型器械，承重性能十分可靠。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The underground city where players live in the game world is "
"roughly divided into four types of terrain: the only three huge "
"cylindrical hollow \"Main Shafts,\" the narrow and dense residential "
"areas called \"Pipes,\" the spacious and well-connected \"Metro\" linking"
" all parts horizontally, and the \"Elevators\" used for surface-to-"
"underground transportation.   &emsp;&emsp;The \"Main Shafts\" are the "
"primary activity areas for underground city residents, including "
"commercial districts, energy facilities, administrative districts, and "
"other comprehensive functions. At the very top of each shaft is a giant "
"single lens that filters radiation. Because the shafts are very deep, "
"only at noon is there a brief moment of sacred light illumination; the "
"rest of the time is lit by never-extinguished neon lights and electronic "
"screens (before daylight arrives, there is a ceremony of turning off "
"lights to wait for the light).   &emsp;&emsp;The \"Pipes\" are the "
"resting spaces for residents. The Pipe area is divided into twelve zones "
"(six inner zones, six outer zones — the more prestigious one's status, "
"the closer to the core one lives).   &emsp;&emsp;The \"Metro\" is the "
"horizontal transportation network, operating at extremely high speeds and"
" very convenient, capable of reaching any part of the underground city "
"within half an hour. Located at the center of the three Main Shafts is "
"the Metro's \"Grand Hub,\" a large hollow area with three-dimensional "
"dispatch tracks and a central control core. Each car of the metro train "
"can operate independently, detaching during travel to be assigned to "
"different tracks.   &emsp;&emsp;The \"Elevators\" are vertical "
"transportation routes, equipped with giant lifting platforms, emergency "
"ejection vertical rails, and backup staircases (though almost no one is "
"willing to climb these stairs). The platforms are commonly used for "
"transporting troops and large equipment, with very reliable load-bearing "
"performance."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:224
msgid "地下城市竖井通往军事学院的一个连通区域"
msgstr "A connecting area from the underground city shaft to the Military Academy"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:228
msgid "地下城市竖井通往军事学院的一个连通区域（画师：桀）"
msgstr ""
"A connecting area from the underground city shaft to the Military Academy"
" (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:231
msgid "五、脆弱的世外桃源（游戏世界）"
msgstr "5. The Fragile Paradise (Game World)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:235
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;太阳灾害出现后，在靠近新极夜区的一片山脉之中，存在着一块被群山环绕的小盆地，在严寒和酷暑气候区的夹缝之中，以及环绕的高山对异常气候的阻隔下，却意外的产生了一块人类宜居的地块。这里太阳的紫外线辐射仍旧很强，但是日照倾角较大传递的热量有限，同时在极夜地区寒冷空气调和之下，形成了四级如春的恒温之域，全年气温均在10到30摄氏度之间。因为四面环绕的群山海拔较高，也阻拦了很多变异生物的迁移。一些为躲避太阳灾害的人们惊喜地找到了这里，在温和适宜的气候之中，与外界逐渐脱离联系，并渐渐恢复到了农耕时代的生活，把这里也建设成了人类宜居的新的室外桃源。可随着这块宝地被更多幸存的人们发现，更加频繁的人类活动的痕迹也引起了变异生物的关注，以及极夜区日照线范围还在随着太阳活动持续变化，这块世外桃源宝地享有的脆弱的自然平衡已经变得似乎随时都会被打破与摧毁。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;世外桃源之地地理上属于高原上的盆地，气候属于地中海气候，生长的树木没有特别高大，地面遍布着灌木和茂密的草地。有幸存人类新修建的小镇和农田。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;四面是青色的高山环绕，地上都是充满生机的绿地。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;After the solar disaster occurred, in a mountain range near "
"the new polar night region, there exists a small basin surrounded by "
"mountains. Caught between the severe cold and extreme heat climate zones,"
" and shielded by the surrounding high mountains from the abnormal "
"climate, an unexpectedly human-habitable area was created. The sun's "
"ultraviolet radiation here is still strong, but the large solar zenith "
"angle limits the heat transmitted, and tempered by the cold air from the "
"polar night region, it has formed a恒温 domain with spring-like weather "
"year-round, with annual temperatures ranging between 10 and 30 degrees "
"Celsius. Because the surrounding mountains have high elevations, they "
"also block the migration of many mutant creatures. Some people fleeing "
"the solar disaster surprisingly found this place. In the mild and "
"pleasant climate, they gradually lost contact with the outside world and "
"slowly returned to an agrarian lifestyle, building this place into a new "
"habitable paradise for humanity. However, as more survivors discovered "
"this treasure land, increasingly frequent traces of human activity also "
"attracted the attention of mutant creatures. Meanwhile, the polar night "
"region's daylight boundary continues to shift with ongoing solar "
"activity. The fragile natural balance enjoyed by this paradise seems as "
"though it could be broken and destroyed at any moment.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Geographically, this paradise is a basin on a plateau with a "
"Mediterranean climate. The trees growing here are not particularly tall, "
"and the ground is covered with shrubs and lush grasslands. There are "
"newly built small towns and farmland established by surviving humans.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;It is surrounded by green mountains on all sides, with "
"vibrant green land covering the ground."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:240
msgid "脆弱的世外桃源"
msgstr "The Fragile Paradise"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:244
msgid "脆弱的世外桃源（画师：桀）"
msgstr "The Fragile Paradise (Artist: Jie)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:247
msgid "六、主角的居所（现实世界）"
msgstr "6. The Protagonist's Residence (Real World)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/scene.md:251
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;现实世界也确实发生了太阳红巨化爆发的事件，但是太阳的爆发带来灾害的同时也带来的巨量能源，结果是迅速推动了人类科技的发展。现在人类的困境已从抵挡太阳灾害转为了应对超前科技应用的不良后果。通过人类修建近地场戴森球装置，对太阳辐射已完成了可控的屏蔽、采集和利用，并且此时地球上的气候环境也已完全由人造的气候进行掌控。人类面临的新危机则是使用过度消耗能源的超前科技会带来人类无法评估后果，会构建出人类难以掌控其规则的新的世界系统"
"（Hyper-"
"Chaos高阶混沌系统）。所以人类政府开始宣扬”低熵化“的生活方式，减少过度的能源使用，开始推动人们从关注对物理世界的改造，变为更多关注对精神世界的探寻和追求。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;主角完全过上了”低熵化“的生活方式。居住在几乎没有饰物，只有必要的家具，居室的建筑形状充满了极简设计的几何形状，色调以黑白灰色为主的公寓。只有当主角感房间单调的时候，会通过启动植入义眼的增强现实功能，在自己的视觉中给单调的墙面上挂上显示屏幕或是可以看见外面世界的落地窗的投影。房间的中间是一个装有维生装置的躺椅，当主角需要长时间接入游戏世界，就会躺在这个特质的躺椅上，启动冬眠模式，维生装置会让人体进入低温休眠状态，但是却能保持大脑活动的机能。开始”冬眠“后，生活的房间也会调低所有照明装置，只看到主角的义眼还在闪烁着奇异的光亮。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;In the real world, the solar red giant eruption event did "
"indeed occur, but the solar eruption brought not only disaster but also "
"massive energy resources, resulting in rapid advancement of human "
"technology. Humanity's current dilemma has shifted from resisting the "
"solar disaster to dealing with the adverse consequences of applying超前 "
"technology. Through the construction of a near-Earth Dyson sphere device,"
" humanity has achieved controllable shielding, collection, and "
"utilization of solar radiation, and the climate environment on Earth is "
"now completely controlled by artificial climate systems. The new crisis "
"humanity faces is that the excessive energy consumption of超前 technology "
"could bring consequences that humans cannot assess, potentially "
"constructing a new world system whose rules humans would struggle to "
"control (the Hyper-Chaos High-Order Chaos System). Therefore, the human "
"government began promoting a \"low-entropy\" lifestyle, reducing "
"excessive energy use, and shifting people's focus from transforming the "
"physical world to exploring and pursuing the spiritual world.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;The protagonist has fully adopted the \"low-entropy\" "
"lifestyle. They live in an apartment with almost no decorations, only "
"essential furniture. The building's architectural shapes are filled with "
"minimalist geometric designs, with a color palette dominated by black, "
"white, and gray. Only when the protagonist finds the room monotonous do "
"they activate the augmented reality function implanted in their "
"prosthetic eye, projecting display screens or floor-to-ceiling windows "
"showing the outside world onto the bare walls in their vision. In the "
"middle of the room is a recliner equipped with a life-support device. "
"When the protagonist needs to connect to the game world for extended "
"periods, they lie on this special recliner and activate hibernation mode."
" The life-support device puts the body into a low-temperature dormant "
"state while maintaining brain activity functions. After \"hibernation\" "
"begins, the room also dims all lighting devices, with only the "
"protagonist's prosthetic eye still flickering with a strange light."

